{
  "name": "WW Enquiry Auto-Process",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-trigger",
      "name": "Every 15 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "filters": {
          "from": "",
          "subject": "",
          "readStatus": "unread"
        },
        "format": "simple",
        "options": {
          "maxResults": 10
        }
      },
      "id": "gmail-search",
      "name": "Search Gmail for Unread WW Enquiries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [470, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "psnm-gmail-oauth",
          "name": "PSNM Gmail OAuth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "email_subject",
              "name": "email_subject",
              "value": "={{ $json.subject }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "email_body",
              "name": "email_body",
              "value": "={{ $json.snippet }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "email_from",
              "name": "email_from",
              "value": "={{ $json.from }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "email_id",
              "name": "email_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "extract-email-data",
      "name": "Extract Email Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [690, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929",
        "text": "=# Email Classification for WhichWarehouse Enquiry\n\nAnalyze this warehouse storage enquiry and classify it based on PSNM's capabilities:\n\n**Subject:** {{ $json.email_subject }}\n**From:** {{ $json.email_from }}\n**Body:** {{ $json.email_body }}\n\n**PSNM Capabilities:**\n- Location: Barnsley, South Yorkshire\n- Storage: 4000+ pallet spaces, secure, temperature controlled\n- Handling: forklifts, pallet wrapping, inventory management\n- Access: 24/7 customer access available\n- Services: picking, packing, dispatch coordination\n\n**Classification Options:**\n- FULL_FIT: Perfect match for PSNM capabilities and location\n- PARTIAL_FIT: Some match but with caveats (e.g. slightly far but workable)\n- WRONG_FIT: Clearly wrong location, product type we can't handle, or hazmat we can't store\n\n**Output format (JSON only):**\n{\n  \"classification\": \"FULL_FIT|PARTIAL_FIT|WRONG_FIT\",\n  \"reasoning\": \"Brief explanation\",\n  \"extracted_data\": {\n    \"location\": \"location mentioned if any\",\n    \"pallet_count\": \"number of pallets mentioned\",\n    \"product_type\": \"what they're storing\",\n    \"hazmat\": true/false\n  }\n}",
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 1024,
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "claude-classify",
      "name": "Claude: Classify Enquiry",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [910, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "anthropicApi": {
          "id": "anthropic-api",
          "name": "Anthropic API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-fit",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.classification }}",
              "rightValue": "FULL_FIT,PARTIAL_FIT",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "contains"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "check-fit",
      "name": "Is Full or Partial Fit?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1130, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929",
        "text": "=# Draft Reply for WhichWarehouse Enquiry\n\nWrite a professional email reply to this warehouse storage enquiry:\n\n**Original Email:**\nSubject: {{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_subject }}\nFrom: {{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_from }}\nBody: {{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_body }}\n\n**Classification:** {{ $json.classification }}\n**Extracted Data:** {{ JSON.stringify($json.extracted_data) }}\n\n**PSNM Details to Include:**\n- Company: Pallet Storage Near Me (PSNM)\n- Location: Barnsley, South Yorkshire S70 area\n- Capacity: 4000+ pallet spaces available\n- Services: secure storage, 24/7 access, picking/packing, dispatch coordination\n- Rates: £X per pallet per week (fetch from Supabase config if available, or say \"competitive rates\")\n- Contact: Reply to this email or call Ben on 07506 255033\n\n**Tone:**\n- Professional but friendly\n- Ben's voice: direct, no corporate fluff\n- If PARTIAL_FIT, acknowledge the fit isn't perfect but explain how PSNM could still help\n- End with clear next step (call to discuss, or send pallet list)\n\n**Output:** Plain text email body only, no JSON.",
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 1024,
          "temperature": 0.7
        }
      },
      "id": "claude-draft-reply",
      "name": "Claude: Draft Reply",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [1350, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "anthropicApi": {
          "id": "anthropic-api",
          "name": "Anthropic API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert",
        "schema": {
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "email_id",
              "displayName": "email_id",
              "required": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "email_subject",
              "displayName": "email_subject",
              "required": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "email_from",
              "displayName": "email_from",
              "required": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "classification",
              "displayName": "classification",
              "required": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "extracted_data",
              "displayName": "extracted_data",
              "required": false,
              "type": "json"
            },
            {
              "id": "status",
              "displayName": "status",
              "required": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "draft_body",
              "displayName": "draft_body",
              "required": false,
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "table": "psnm_ww_enquiries",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "email_id": "={{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_id }}",
            "email_subject": "={{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_subject }}",
            "email_from": "={{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_from }}",
            "classification": "={{ $('Claude: Classify Enquiry').item.json.classification }}",
            "extracted_data": "={{ $('Claude: Classify Enquiry').item.json.extracted_data }}",
            "status": "draft_ready",
            "draft_body": "={{ $json.output }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "supabase-insert",
      "name": "Insert to Supabase",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1570, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-api",
          "name": "Supabase API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "createDraft",
        "subject": "=Re: {{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_subject }}",
        "message": "={{ $('Claude: Draft Reply').item.json.output }}",
        "replyTo": "={{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_id }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gmail-create-draft",
      "name": "Create Gmail Draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1790, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "psnm-gmail-oauth",
          "name": "PSNM Gmail OAuth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $env.TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID }}",
        "text": "=🆕 New WW Enquiry\n\n**From:** {{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_from }}\n**Subject:** {{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_subject }}\n**Classification:** {{ $('Claude: Classify Enquiry').item.json.classification }}\n\n📝 Draft reply ready in Gmail\n\nRef: {{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_id }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "telegram-alert",
      "name": "Telegram Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [2010, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "telegram-bot",
          "name": "RBTR Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "addLabels",
        "messageId": "={{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_id }}",
        "labelIds": ["Label_1"],
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gmail-mark-read",
      "name": "Mark Email as Read",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [2230, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "psnm-gmail-oauth",
          "name": "PSNM Gmail OAuth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert",
        "table": "psnm_ww_enquiries",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "email_id": "={{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_id }}",
            "email_subject": "={{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_subject }}",
            "email_from": "={{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_from }}",
            "classification": "={{ $('Claude: Classify Enquiry').item.json.classification }}",
            "extracted_data": "={{ $('Claude: Classify Enquiry').item.json.extracted_data }}",
            "status": "wrong_fit"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "supabase-log-wrong-fit",
      "name": "Log WRONG_FIT to Supabase",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1350, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-api",
          "name": "Supabase API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "addLabels",
        "messageId": "={{ $('Extract Email Data').item.json.email_id }}",
        "labelIds": ["Label_1"],
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gmail-mark-read-wrong",
      "name": "Mark Email as Read (WRONG_FIT)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1570, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "psnm-gmail-oauth",
          "name": "PSNM Gmail OAuth2"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
